<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>About - URL Shortener</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
  </head>

  <body>
    <%- include("partials/header") %>

    <main class="page-container">
      <section class="about-section">
        <div class="about-header">
          <span class="about-badge">ABOUT THE PROJECT</span>

          <h1>About URL Shortener</h1>

          <p class="about-intro">
            A simple and secure URL Shortener that helps you create, manage, and
            share short links easily.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-content">
          <div class="about-card">
            <h2>🔗 What is URL Shortener?</h2>

            <p>
              URL Shortener is a web application that converts long URLs into
              short, easy-to-share links. Instead of sharing a long and
              complicated web address, you can create a simple short link and
              use it anywhere.
            </p>

            <p>
              Users can create short URLs, use custom short codes, track clicks,
              and manage their previously created links from their account.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="about-card">
            <h2>✨ Key Features</h2>

            <ul class="feature-list">
              <li>
                <strong>Short URL Creation</strong>
                <span>Convert long URLs into short and shareable links.</span>
              </li>

              <li>
                <strong>Custom Short Codes</strong>
                <span>Create a personalized short code when available.</span>
              </li>

              <li>
                <strong>Click Tracking</strong>
                <span
                  >Track how many times your shortened links are visited.</span
                >
              </li>

              <li>
                <strong>URL Management</strong>
                <span>View, update, and delete your shortened URLs.</span>
              </li>

              <li>
                <strong>User Profile</strong>
                <span>Manage your account information from your profile.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="about-card">
            <h2>🔐 Account & Security</h2>

            <p>
              The application also includes authentication and account security
              features to protect user accounts.
            </p>

            <ul class="feature-list security-list">
              <li>
                <strong>Email Verification</strong>
                <span
                  >Verify your email address using a verification link or
                  code.</span
                >
              </li>

              <li>
                <strong>Google Login</strong>
                <span>Sign in using your Google account through OAuth.</span>
              </li>

              <li>
                <strong>Forgot Password</strong>
                <span>Reset your password securely when you forget it.</span>
              </li>

              <li>
                <strong>Change Password</strong>
                <span>Change your account password after logging in.</span>
              </li>

              <li>
                <strong>Secure Sessions</strong>
                <span
                  >Access and refresh tokens are used to manage authenticated
                  sessions.</span
                >
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="about-card">
            <h2>⚙️ How It Works</h2>

            <div class="steps">
              <div class="step">
                <span class="step-number">01</span>

                <div>
                  <h3>Enter URL</h3>
                  <p>Enter the long URL that you want to shorten.</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="step">
                <span class="step-number">02</span>

                <div>
                  <h3>Create Short Link</h3>
                  <p>
                    The application creates a unique short code for your
                    original URL.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="step">
                <span class="step-number">03</span>

                <div>
                  <h3>Share</h3>
                  <p>Copy and share your short URL with others.</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="step">
                <span class="step-number">04</span>

                <div>
                  <h3>Redirect & Track</h3>
                  <p>
                    When someone opens the short URL, they are redirected to the
                    original URL and the click count is updated.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="about-card">
            <h2>🛠️ Technology Used</h2>

            <div class="tech-list">
              <span>Node.js</span>
              <span>Express.js</span>
              <span>MongoDB</span>
              <span>EJS</span>
              <span>JWT</span>
              <span>OAuth</span>
              <span>Nodemailer</span>
              <span>Argon2</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="about-card about-footer-card">
            <h2>🚀 Built for Simple Link Management</h2>

            <p>
              The goal of this project is to provide a clean and easy-to-use URL
              shortening experience while also implementing real-world
              authentication, security, email verification, session management,
              and URL management features.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <%- include("partials/footer") %>
  </body>
</html>
